00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:06.340
Reigen Arataka was here

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:08.760
Happy Trip Journal

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:13.070
Wow...

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:16.180
Um, the matron made some rice balls
with Ibodai butterfish rice—

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:17.430
Serizawa-san!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:20.640
Where the heck did you go?! 
I was looking for you!

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:23.030
Uh... S-Sorry about that.

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:26.260
I took a bath in the hot springs 
over there and watched some TV...

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.110
Thank goodness...

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:29.570
I'm so happy you came back safe...

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:32.900
<i>Thank goodness. I thought 
he was going to yell at me.</i>

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:35.530
So, were you able to find out
what caused this?

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.480
No, not yet.

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:41.250
I think I'm nearing my limit, though.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:48.030
Oh, hey... Please, help yourself.

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:49.100
Huh?

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:56.510
Here you go.

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:01.700
I feel alive again!

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:03.380
Wait, hang on a sec.

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:05.310
Where the hell did you get this?

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.030
Also, why are you dressed like that?

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:11.820
Uh, I got the rice balls from the room, 
and these are pajamas from the inn...

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:17.280
What? You're able to go there?

00:16:18.230 --> 00:16:18.740
Yes.

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:21.770
Okay, seriously!

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:27.290
Why the hell didn't you take me with you?!

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:28.710
I-I'm sorry...

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:33.930
The book I read about business etiquette
said to just follow boss's orders.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.840
So that's why you went 
back and forth by yourself?

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:38.210
Y-Yes...

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:45.100
<i>Calm down. Don't get angry at a newbie.</i>

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:47.440
<i>He's just incredibly awkward.</i>

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:49.820
Listen up, Serizawa.

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:52.530
Reading the business manuals
of the world is important,

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:56.870
but what's more important 
is to think for yourself.

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:03.100
You're no longer anybody's slave
or a shut-in.

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:04.560
R-Right...

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:08.130
Please, let me help you somehow.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.130
In that case, could you...

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.840
Bring Mob here?

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:12.880
Yes, sir!

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:16.010
Wow, this is intense.

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:18.220
This place is a mess.

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:20.680
Reigen Arataka was here

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:21.040
What's this?

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:25.520
What's wrong, Master? 
Why do you look like that?

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.900
W-Well, you know...

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:31.030
I was just trying to find out 
what was causing this phenomenon.

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:34.650
Heh, you probably got all depressed 
because you couldn't get out.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:38.240
All right! All of you work together 
to destroy this dimension!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:40.740
Huh? But weren't you going to 
find out what's causing it?

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:41.900
I don't care about that anymore!

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.290
The answer is I have no idea
what's causing this!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:49.320
Listen, this world is filled with things
that are incomprehensible to the human brain!

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:50.710
Remember that!

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.920
But the cause is right there.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:53.830
Isn't it?

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:56.540
Yeah, I feel some kind of 
energy from that mountain.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:58.770
Oh, so it <i>was</i> that.

00:17:58.770 --> 00:18:00.390
Should we try getting closer to it?

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:15.690
There's something on the 
other side of the mountain.

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:17.310
The hell is that?

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:21.870
I'm pretty sure I've seen 
this shape before...

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:24.080
Oh, it's Ibogami-sama.

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:26.880
There used to be a hole around here
that led to another world,

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:29.580
but a god called "Ibogami-sama"
sealed it up, apparently.

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:33.380
So this mountain is Ibogami-sama...

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:37.590
And because of that sticky stuff out there,
Ibogami-sama's powers are weakening.

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.450
Congratulations, Serizawa-kun.

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:42.550
You pass. Excellent work figuring it out.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:46.770
Yes. That sticky substance is what's 
causing this supernatural phenomenon.

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:50.450
Huh? But you just said you didn't 
know what was causing this...

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:53.480
You fool! I was just testing you!

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.940
I was testing you to see 
if you could figure it out!

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:59.300
Well, now that the test is over, 
let's get the heck outta here.

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:01.410
Get rid of that sticky stuff.

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:46.810
Gross! It's salty!

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.540
Where have I encountered this before?

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:05.390
I'm back!

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:09.150
I'm so sick of this...

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:12.060
Wait, my nose feels better.

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:14.060
I wonder why.

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:15.660
How strange.

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:18.480
Wriggle.

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:24.960
So that's it.

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:28.160
<b>Ibogami
Hot
Springs</b>

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:28.160
Wha? A wart in her nose?

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:29.500
Yeah.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:34.620
The family of matrons,
having worshiped Ibogami for generations,

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:37.900
probably developed psychic powers
without even noticing.

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:41.340
That power was sealing
the entrance to the parallel world.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:44.800
And that power was weakened 
because she caught a cold.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.210
Yeah... Because her powers were weakened,

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:48.870
the entrance to the other world opened,

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:53.770
and if you fell asleep inside
the Ibogami Tunnel, you got sucked in.

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:55.590
What the hell?

00:20:55.590 --> 00:20:59.290
Psychic powers will always be a mystery.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:04.370
We got to go into the hot springs 
and eat delicious food today.

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:05.700
I'm glad we came.

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:08.460
I never knew going on 
vacation was so much fun.

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:11.160
Oh? Is that so?

00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:14.120
All right, then. Wanna have a pillow fight?

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:15.620
I slept so much during the day,

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:17.260
I don't think I'll fall asleep any time soon.

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:19.930
Well, I'm tired.

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:21.590
It's late, so why don't we hit the hay?

00:21:21.810 --> 00:21:24.930
You guys are middle school kids. 
Stop sounding like old people.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.050
Come on. Pillow fight time.

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:29.520
Reigen-san, behave yourself.

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:32.770
Um... I'll join you if that's an order...

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:34.790
Wh-What the hell is your problem?

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:37.730
Talk about party poopers! 
I was just kidding, anyway.

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:40.440
After you rolled up your sleeves? Please.

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:42.180
Shut up and go to bed.

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:44.590
Right. Goodnight.

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:49.390
<i>Yeah... I can't sleep at all.</i>

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:56.420
So yeah, I took care of
the parallel world situation for you.

00:21:56.420 --> 00:21:58.780
I think you'll be okay now.

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:01.370
But if you ever need anything again,
please give me a call.

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:02.000
Spirits and Such Consultation Office    The New Star of the Spiritual World

00:22:02.400 --> 00:22:07.720
If you bring in my business card 
next time, you'll get five percent off.

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:10.920
Oh, my... You're wonderful, Master Reigen.

00:22:10.920 --> 00:22:15.020
Now we can continue business 
at our inn without worrying.

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:18.020
<b>Ibogami</b>

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:17.270
Thank you very much.

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:23.230
Oh, also... If something like this 
ever happens again, please drink this.

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:25.990
Prayer Pills

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:25.990
runny noses

00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:26.180
They're special pills imbued
with my spiritual energy.

00:22:26.180 --> 00:22:28.950
It's a medicine that'll make 
Ibogami-sama's powers stronger.

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:31.780
Thank you so much for your consideration.

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:33.910
Just doing my job.

00:22:34.870 --> 00:22:36.370
Have a wonderful day!

00:22:36.760 --> 00:22:38.830
Please be careful getting home!

00:22:41.620 --> 00:22:42.310
Here you go.

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:46.380
Spirits and Such Consultation    Office Assistant

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:46.380
Since we moved locations,
I had new business cards made.

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:49.290
But I'm only part-time. Is it okay 
for me to have business cards?

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:50.840
It's fine. Just take them.

00:22:51.360 --> 00:22:53.110
Thank you so much.

00:22:53.110 --> 00:22:55.560
These business cards just scream "poor."

00:22:55.840 --> 00:22:59.020
Nii-san, I wouldn't go around
 giving those to people.

00:22:59.650 --> 00:23:02.590
And Serizawa, here are your business cards.

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:02.940
Spirits and Such Consultation Office     Apprentice

00:23:03.850 --> 00:23:05.370
A-Are you sure?

00:23:05.370 --> 00:23:08.580
Yeah. Starting today, 
you're officially one of us.

00:23:08.580 --> 00:23:10.410
Better keep working hard.

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:12.900
Y-Yes, sir! I'll do my best!

00:23:13.980 --> 00:23:15.480
You guys want some, too?

00:23:15.480 --> 00:23:16.150
No.

00:23:16.150 --> 00:23:16.800
No, thank you.

00:23:16.800 --> 00:23:18.030
Nah, I'm good.

00:23:25.770 --> 00:23:28.590
Sorry to keep you waiting, Mother.

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:33.640
What? Did your cold get better?

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:37.120
It did. It just suddenly 
went away last night.

00:23:37.120 --> 00:23:38.850
You should be careful too, Mother.

00:23:38.850 --> 00:23:41.560
Ibogami-sama will protect us.

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:47.060
Oh, goodness me. Did I catch her cold?
